<title>NETHERLANDS: Philips Q1 segment revenues and income.</title>
<headline>Philips Q1 segment revenues and income.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philips revenues and income from operations by product segment first quarter 1997 in millions of guilders:</p>
<p>REVENUES -----</p>
<p>    Lighting				     2,370  vs  2,209</p>
<p>    Consumer products			  5,117  vs  5,375</p>
<p>    Components and semiconductors	  4,295  vs  3,886</p>
<p>    Professional products/systems	  2,727  vs  2,650</p>
<p>    Software and services		    2,943  vs  2,665</p>
<p>    Miscellaneous				  846  vs  1,112</p>
<p>    Intersegment sales		 debit 2,162  vs  2,266 debit</p>
<p>    Total third-party sales		 16,136  vs 15,631</p>
<p>INCOME FROM OPERATIONS -----</p>
<p>    Lighting					 275  vs    274</p>
<p>    Consumer products		   profit 206  vs     52 loss</p>
<p>    Components and semiconductors	    429  vs    496</p>
<p>    Professional products,systems     loss  54  vs     61 loss</p>
<p>    Software and services			181  vs    162</p>
<p>    Miscellaneous				   44  vs     90</p>
<p>    Unallocated costs/revenues	 debit 245  vs    219 debit</p>
<p>    Total income from operations	     836  vs    690</p>
<p>    Income from ops as pct of sales	  5.2  vs    4.4</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
